      "content": "The Apache BookKeeper HTTP Admin API provides REST endpoints for managing and monitoring BookKeeper clusters, bookies, ledgers, and auto-recovery operations. It enables programmatic cluster administration, ledger inspection, bookie health monitoring, and garbage collection management.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Apache BookKeeper Community",
